441 float pairs + NaN/±inf) | `cmp` byte-identical, 3,648 lines |\n| Fuzz: all 512 exponent/sign corners + 40,000 random raw bit patterns + direct `printLine`(incl. NULL, `\"\"`, `%d`-bearing strings)/`printIntLine`(incl. `INT_MIN`/`INT_MAX`) | `cmp` **byte-identical, 446,157 lines** |\n| UB-path coverage in that fuzz | `INT_MIN` emitted 32,955×; divide-by-zero message 34,130× |\n\nNo sub-agents were needed — the library was small enough to translate directly. Nothing in `c_src/` was modified (all C build artifacts went to `$TMPDIR`)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":498,"cache_read_input_tokens":33829,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":498,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8de771d9-8d17-4ee0-82a5-4f4fbb87f4f6","uuid":"274fc3ff-f05b-446c-aacf-cbf0601a943e","timestamp":"2026-08-17T20:30:21.600Z"}
